        <mxCell id="tDelegations" value="&lt;b&gt;★ ApprovalDelegations&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Ủy quyền duyệt thay 代理承認 — MỚI&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr&gt;PK Id : int IDENTITY&lt;br&gt;FK DelegatorEmployeeId → Employees (Restrict)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;người đi vắng&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;FK DelegateEmployeeId → Employees (Restrict)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;người duyệt thay&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;FK FormDefinitionId NULL (Restrict)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;NULL = ủy quyền mọi loại đơn&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;· FromDate / ToDate : datetime2&lt;br&gt;· Reason : nvarchar(500) NULL&lt;br&gt;· IsDeleted : bit = 0&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;IX (DelegateEmployeeId, FromDate, ToDate)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;CHECK Delegator &lt;&gt; Delegate&lt;/i&gt;" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Consolas;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=2;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
